window.products.push({"id":807166,"name":"3 Pieces 12 Inch Christmas Wooden Large Joy Letter Home Sign Rustic Christmas Wooden Letter Wreath Ornaments for Xmas Holiday Indoor Outdoor Home Wall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iR1sHjySL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tasteful decoration: the JOY wooden letters are simple in style, which look well when positioned above the mantel, also ideal to hang on your front door or in your home as you celebrate the Christmas or other festival in winter Elegant and classic: these wooden home letters are designed with beautiful forms and won't fade easily, which are large enough to be noticed on the wall and the O letter can be replaced by a wreath if you like Multiple applications: JOY letter home sign is nice hanging decoration for wall, door, window, cabinet and so on, easy to add warm atmosphere at home, creating festival joy for your Thanksgiving or Christmas Reliable material: made of natural poplar wood, these home letters are non-toxic and no odder smell, reliable and safe for home decoration, sturdy and won't break easily, which can be applied for a long time What you'll get: there are 3 pieces of 12 inch wooden letters in this package, J, O, Y，1 piece for per letter, sweet home decoration and also cheerful present on home warming party, wedding, baby shower and more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iR1sHjySL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jetec","source_asin":"B08LBK5P3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LBK5P3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LBK5P3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":807167,"name":"Yuengs 14oz Glass Tea Cup with a Lid & Strainer Portable Cute Cat Tail Heat Resistant Mugs (purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CBgAMZaJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Yuengs cat lovers tea mugs holds 14 ounces of liquid and comes in 6 beautiful colors that you can choose your favorite color or you can buy one set to add colorful fun to you life. believe me, you won't disappointed with this charming, adorable cat shape tea cup . It is perfect for brewing and steeping tea and is commonly used as a regular cup for hot beverages such as coffee, hot chocolate and soup, and cold beverages such as ice tea, juice, milk or water. To brew your rich flavored tea, twist off the lid and easily remove the strainer. Place the loose-leaf tea or tea bag into the cup and then put the stainless-steel strainer back on. Pour hot water through the strainer into the cup and let it steep. Enjoy drinking your tea while the strainer prevents any leaf debris from getting through. To enjoy a lighter tea, twist off the lid and keep the strainer on. Place the loose-leaf tea or tea bag on top of the strainer. Pour hot water over the tea very slowly, then remove the strainer with the tea on top. Easy to clean, just remove the strainer and wash it under the faucet. Specifications Colors: White/Black/Pink/Blue/Purple/light Pink Capacity: 14 ounces /420ml Size: 3.5 inches diameter by 5 inches high  Contains: 1 plastic lid; 1 stainless-steel strainer; and 1 glass cup  Package: Come with a nice box package Not dishwasher proof and should not be heated in a microwave. With our customer focused policy, please do not hesitate, purchase our novelty cat mugs and you will love it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CBgAMZaJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yuengs","source_asin":"B07G4D8G7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G4D8G7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G4D8G7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
