window.products.push({"id":807176,"name":"Honey-Can-Do Electric Tortilla Toaster, Black KCH-09370 Black,Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UTqqhLOoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Often, the focus for tacos is the fillings. And that makes sense. There’s plenty of reason to focus on tender carne asada, succulent pork belly, or a shredded spicy chicken. That said, don’t overlook the tortillas. The humble tortilla is the home, the edible transport vehicle for any taco’s tasty filling. If the tortilla ain’t right, the taco won’t be right. Now, any taqueria will tell you that a key to a great tortilla is to toast it. And there are few ways better for toasting a tortilla perfectly each time than this electric tortilla toaster. With six slots and a toasting time of under 60 seconds, you can get dinner started faster than having to wait to scorch and flip individual tortillas over a flame or pan. Actually, when you consider the ease and consistency this tortilla toaster brings to taco night, maybe it is all right to focus on the fillings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UTqqhLOoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey-Can-Do","source_asin":"B09WSK3T3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WSK3T3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WSK3T3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
