window.products.push({"id":807605,"name":"HEATGENE Towel Warmer 8 Bar Plug-in Curved Bath Towel Heater Towel Warmer for Bathroom Plug-in Drying Rack Brushed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gVo5Kr-IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CURVED BAR DESIGN: The HEATGENE towel warmer’s curved design is convenient for hanging towels and uses 8 bars to evenly distribute heat, warming up to 2 large towels or bathrobes. The color will fit any decor. You can put multiple items on it at once, but not overlapping, making it ideal for warming up towels. Your family will get cozy towels whenever they step out of the shower FAST HEATING & OVERHEAT PROTECTION: Multi-layer stainless steel composite structure, rapid heating, rated power 115W(2 amp), only 15 minutes, it can be heated to 110 °F, 30 minutes to reach the optimal working temperature of 130 °F (based on room temperature 68 °F), energy-saving and high efficiency SPACE-SAVING & WALL-MOUNTED: The towel warmer is a perfect towel heating solution for homes. This is a wall-mounted and Plug-in towel warmer that you can install on the wall. Its design maximizes the space of your floor space, modern style, suitable for space of your home bathroom, hotel, spa, and even for the outdoor area. Not only a perfect towel heater but also a wonderful bathroom decoration EASY INSTALLATION AND CLEAN: The towel warmer is easy to clean and made of durable 304 stainless steel with either brushed or mirror polish finishes. All necessary hardware and tools are included in the package, and it is easy to install with its included instructions. The towel warmer is powered by a standard electrical outlet (Rated voltage: AC 120V/60Hz) 2 YEAR WARRANTY: 2-year warranty is covered by our manufacturer’s warranty for peace of mind","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gVo5Kr-IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HEATGENE","source_asin":"B087BLMWGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087BLMWGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087BLMWGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":807606,"name":"Mt.Jun 6-Pack Secure & Quiet Plastic S Hooks, Flexible Neck for Easy Twist & Lock, Completely Rust-Free, Holds up to 5 lbs, White, Small (2.4 inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ouHm6EesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Twist-Lock Design: These S-shaped plastic hooks feature a flexible, twist-lock mechanism at one end, ensuring a secure grip on the rod and preventing accidental detachment when retrieving items. Scratch and Noise-Free: The plastic material eliminates the risk of metal scratching or causing unpleasant screeching sounds when in use, protecting your rods and providing a quiet hanging experience. Premium Material: Our S-shaped hooks are made from top-grade PP and TPE materials, making them resistant to rust and corrosion. This ensures long-lasting durability, even in humid environments such as bathrooms and kitchens. In addition, the plastic material eliminates the harsh friction sound that is often produced by metal hooks. Versatile and Value Pack: With 6 hooks included in each pack, our hooks offer a practical and cost-effective storage solution for a wide range of items, including clothes, hats, cookware, towels, and more. Whether you're organizing your closet, kitchen, or bathroom, these hooks provide ample storage space to meet your needs. Size Options: Choose from small (2.4 inches) or large (3.5 inches) hooks for rods up to 2cm or 3cm in diameter. Small hooks hold up to 5lbs, and large hooks hold up to 10lbs for versatile storage solutions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ouHm6EesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mt.Jun","source_asin":"B0B9164HXX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9164HXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9164HXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":807607,"name":"InPlace Shelving, 9604676E, Low Profile Wall Shelf with Invisible Brackets, 60 Inch Width x 7.75 Inch Depth x 1.25 Inch Height, Set of 2, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":163.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Hn95od8AS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Organize your home and free countertops from clutter with our stylish wall mounted shelves with invisible brackets! You can use these decorative shelves together to fill up an empty wall or split up this 2 pack and use one of these shelves for living room decor and the other as home office decor. The possibilities are endless! Enjoy all the benefits of high quality shelving any easy installation with any InPlace Shelving floating wall shelf. The durable MDF construction meets new CARB standards and the included metal shelf brackets allow for higher weight capacity than standard brackets. Instructions and hardware are included so you can easily hang each decorative shelf with no visible screws, connectors, or tracks. Each low profile floating shelf with brackets in this set has a beautiful black color and features a sleek contemporary design to compliment any décor. Dimensions: 60 inch width x 7.75 inch depth x 1.25 inch height. Established in 1930, Hyman Inc. has been built on the principles of quality, service, and innovation. Known for marketing innovative home decor and building products for over 85 years, we provide a wide range of home accessories and improvement products for consumers, pros, and home decorators. Today, Lewis Hyman, Inc. and LH Licensed Products Inc. are jointly marketed as Hyman Inc. Our corporate headquarters in Carson, CA includes a 100,000 square foot distribution facility. Our Atlanta, GA office largely supports our e-commerce business and continues to provide our “quick ship” program to the east coast and the southeastern United States. We currently have showrooms in both office locations to collaborate with our partners and customers from all over the world. Finally, we also offer our trade customers access to these same services from our offices in North Carolina, Portugal, Hong Kong, and Shanghai. Use your Amazon gift card and search our other amazing products at our Amazon storefront.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Hn95od8AS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InPlace","source_asin":"B0BG19962X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG19962X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG19962X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":807608,"name":"Family Values Love Kind Compassion Multicolored 10 x 4 Inch Melamine Decorative Spoon Rest with Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rK1w4GtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Family Values Spoon Rest features sentiment \"What makes you smile?, Love a lot, Use kind words, Make peace, Be brave, Hug often, Dream big, Always be grateful, Smile, Show compassion, Do your best, Give thanks for everything, Say I love you, Give joy, Giggle and laugh\". Affirming and encouraging messaging is complemented by vibrant colors and heartfelt design theme. Spoon rest is made of melamine. Top rack dishwasher safe, not intended for microwave. Spoon rest measures approximately 9.5 x 4 inches. Perfect for an inspirational and functional display in a kitchen. Suitable gift for any occasion. Perfect gift for housewarming, wedding, or bridal shower. The Table Talk collection reconnects loved ones at the dinner table through conversation starter phrases and questions that spark engagement. Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rK1w4GtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B0792FPG6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0792FPG6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0792FPG6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
