window.products.push({"id":807682,"name":"Shoe Covers Box - Welcomes Guests to Please Cover Shoes. Indoor Foldable Storage Bin to Fill w/your Favorite Booties. For Homeowner, Real Estate Agent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qeGpmDrfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quality Indoor Shoe Cover Box ✅ Shoe Cover Box for Indoor Use - Sturdy, Stylish Foldable Bootie Boxes. The Perfect size, unfold to 11 x 10.5 x 10.5 inches, and folds flat to 0.75 (3/4) of an inch. Quality construction of non-woven fabric, with an interior lining and an insert to be placed at the bottom of the box for added stability. Bin can easily dispense 200+ disposable shoe covers. A unique design, for men and women, instructing guests to kindly cover shoes. ✅ Homeowners, Help Keep Home Clean – Shoes are a vehicle that welcomes unwanted materials into your home, both visible and invisible. Even asking guests to remove their shoes can also be uncomfortable, embarrassing and unclean. Offering coverings for shoes, feet, or socks is ideal to reduce tracking dirt, mud, and grime onto clean floors and carpets. This shoe cover box sign makes covering shoes automatic for all guests. ✅ Open House Supplies. A MUST HAVE for Realtors or For Sale By Owners (FSBO) who hold open houses. Open houses can be hectic and are often hosted by only one Realtor or Homeowner. This shoe cover storage box politely directs unattended buyers to cover their shoes. Place inside the entryway and fill with your favorite disposable non slip indoor shoe covers. ✅ Real Estate Agent Supplies - Professional Real Estate Agents should put these foldable shoe cover boxes inside every home listing. Loan one to every home you have listed for sale, or send one as a client gift to every new listing. Show the care you take to help protect their carpet and floor from tracking outside rain, snow or dirt inside during showings. These shoe cover holder boxes add an extra touch of class to your Real Estate Listing Service! ✅ Perfect Gift Basket - A clever housewarming gift basket or an ideal gift from a Realtor to Buyer and Seller Clients. Simply fill with disposable shoe covers, fill with gifts or both. A thoughtful client gift for a new real estate listing or a successful closing. Also, a useful gift from a lender to their favorite Real Estate Agents, or a nice contribution when co-hosting an open house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qeGpmDrfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Life Charge","source_asin":"B0B23LWKKX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B23LWKKX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B23LWKKX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
