window.products.push({"id":807750,"name":"HoneyHolly Stainless Steel Water Bottle - 12/17/22/25oz 750ml Vacuum Insulated Metal Reusable Flask Cola Bottle Shape, Keeps Hot & Cold, BPA Free Spor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716TXsWar7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WITH NON SPILL LID CAP - The stainless steel water bottle with vacuum-seal cap provides a good seal and ensures no water leakage. Each drinking bottle is completely leak proof with an easy to open twist-on cap. No matter the temperature of the liquid in this bottle, it will never sweat or be hot to the touch.The narrow mouth and sealed sports bottle makes it easy to throw in your camping pack or back seat, no worrying about any spills. STAND OUT FROM THE CROWD - We all like to be unique and this beautifully colourful water bottle certainly makes a statement. With so many striking colours on offer, if being stylish and on-trend is high on your agenda look no further. P.S. You'll be helping the environment too, less plastic bottles is definitely a good thing for planet earth! THE PERFECT DRINK IN EVERY SCENARIO - This wildly popular bottle can be used at home, work, at the gym, for sports, in your car, at the beach, camping, hiking, travelling & just about any other activity you can dream up! What can be stored inside? Most drinks - including water, tea, coffee & wine. The Bottle will even fit in regular cup holders and its mouth is big enough for ice cubes to fit in. A PREMIUM ITEM, A LIFETIME INDEMITY- We know there are other bottles out there, but here at HoneyHolly we ensure the quality of our products with our lifetime indemnity , it's our promise that if you have a problem we'll fix it; simple as that. The bottle's stainless steel architecture means that it's robust, durable and can withstand some hit (unlike glass based vacuum flasks). The HoneyHolly Bottle is also 100% Leak Proof & BPA + Phthalate free, meaning it's safe for all the family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716TXsWar7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HoneyHolly","source_asin":"B07BVPWLRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BVPWLRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BVPWLRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":807751,"name":"Cheer Collection Soap and Sponge Holder - Silicone Non-Slip Kitchen Counter Sink Organizer and Storage Tray, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gr19y59OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect your counters & make your time in The kitchen simpler with the Cheer Collection Silicone Sponge Holder!  Whether you’re cleaning up dishes or just organizing your kitchen, our silicone sponge holder has you covered. It’s perfect for preventing sponges and scrubbers from making a wet mess on your counters while keeping them safely in place.  The kitchen sink organization tray is waterproof and can handle high heat temperatures without warping, cracking, or deforming. Our kitchen sink tray is made with everyday use in mind to make your day-to-day life just a bit simpler and convenient. Reduce Clutter & Organize Your Space The Simple Way  When it comes to quality, we don’t make any exceptions. This multipurpose kitchen counter tray is made using quality silicone that’s heat-resistant, lightweight, and durable to provide long-term use while being easy to clean and maintain.  Thanks to the spacious size, our scrubber and soap tray for kitchen sink allows you to store and organize a wide variety of kitchen accessories and supplies ranging from cooking utensils to soap dispensers and more to keep your space neatly organized. Features You’ll Love: - Dishwasher safe to make cleanups quick and convenient - Made without using any BPA, latex, plastics, or harsh materials - Can also be used as a utility, bathroom, laundry, and vanity tray - Simple yet elegant to complement the look of any kitchen - It's designed with a non-slip bottom to stay securely in place Make Organizing Your Kitchen Simpler & Easier While Keeping Your Counters Clean With Cheer Collection Countertop tray!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gr19y59OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheer Collection","source_asin":"B09HSRH78M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HSRH78M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HSRH78M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
