window.products.push({"id":807917,"name":"Lenox Winter Greetings 13-Inch Gold-Banded Fine China Platter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511A8JF5PQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A feast for the eyes, this festive platter is graced by the artistry of Catherine McClung. Her rendering of a garland of winter greens ¿ mistletoe, pine, and holly decked with a vibrant red ribbon ¿ distinguishes the Winter Greetings pattern and this holiday platter. Two glorious birds add a festive touch to this exquisite platter. Delicate 24 karat gold trim around the edge enhances the holiday mood. Amazon.com Make holiday dining instantly merry with Winter Greetings fine china serveware from Lenox. With original designs by Lenox artist Catherine McClung, this 13-inch serving platter features a cardinal, a nuthatch, and a chickadee at rest on a wreath of holly and ribbons. Intricately detailed and richly rendered, the images are handsomely complemented by the platter's rim of 24-karat gold. The piece is an excellent size for serving appetizers or a main course, measuring 13-1/4 by 1 by 10-1/4 inches. It is dishwasher-safe and covered by Lenox's lifetime replacement policy. The Winter Greetings pattern also comes in dinnerware and accent pieces. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511A8JF5PQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B00006IZYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006IZYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006IZYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":807918,"name":"Shaker - 750ml and 0.8mm - Plus 12 Professional Cocktail Pieces - 3 Density Strainers, Jigger, Spoons, Pestle, Pourers, Ingredient Tongs, Silicone Coa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8112UY9z8LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADVANCED PROFESSIONAL COCKTAIL SHAKER SET BY BARTENDER SOUL Would You Like to Surprise Your Peers With an Amazing Set of Cocktails? Now You Can Do It! Discover this elegant bartender kit to impress your peers. Prepare your own favorite cocktails at home, perfect to finish this special night. Also you can test new recipes ideas. Drinks like Martini, Margarita or Cosmopolitan won't be a problem anymore. You will be able to prepare easily the best taste cocktails in the world. Why Bartender Soul? BUILT TO LAST - Perfect shiny finish made of high quality 18/8 304 grade anti-rust stainless steel. DESIGNED TO PERFORM - It is built to ensure proper seal anti-leakage. IDEAL FOR A GIFT - Birthday, Bachelorette Party... 100% GUARANTEED - If you have any problem with the product, we guarantee you a FREE replacement or a full refund. What is included? 3 PIECES COBBLER SHAKER for all types of cocktails comes with a built-in strainer useful to strain light ingredients. HAWTHORNE OR BOSTON AND FINE FILTER STRAINERS with detachable spring for easy cleaning to be able to strain big pieces of ingredients. LARGE JIGGER double volume of 1oz and 1.5oz, this one known professionally as a jigger volume. MUDDLER, SPOON AND POURERS are the perfect complements to complete a full cocktail bar set and prepare any single coktail. BOOKLET (physical pocket book) with a welcome essential list of cocktail recipes you can test as soon as you receive the shaker set. EBOOK with an emailed expanded list with the main Bartender Soul recipes selection as well as some tips and tricks. VIP CLUB FREE ACCESS in where you can always find updated ideas online. Click Add to Cart button at the top of the page and Enjoy Your Cocktails!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8112UY9z8LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bartender Soul","source_asin":"B08F5C7BK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F5C7BK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F5C7BK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
