window.products.push({"id":807963,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Lightweight Cotton Flannel Sheet Set - California King, Brown Plaid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j9qLZiOVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Luxurious yarn dyed and available in an assortment of designs, these sheets will add to the comfort of your bedroom. Yarn-dyed fabric for superior quality and plaid patterning on both sides. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com Pinzon’s cozy flannel sheets are a treat to sleep in. Made in Portugal from 100 percent cotton, with a flannel weight of 160 grams per square meter, the fabric is lightly brushed for a soft, supple feel and is pre-washed for durability. Offered in an array of colors, the set coordinates with Pinzon 160-Gram Solid Flannel duvets and shams, or it mixes and matches with Pinzon patterned flannels. Peruse the wide variety of Pinzon solid, printed, and yard-dyed flannel bedding to create a layered look with an ultra-soft feel. Available in several sizes, the California King set offered here includes a 105-by-105-inch flat sheet, a 72-by-84-inch fitted sheet, and two 20-by-41-inch pillowcases. The fitted sheet is designed to fit mattresses up to 18 inches thick. Easy to care for, the set is machine washable and dryable. Fabric Definition Flannel: Flannel fabrics are noted for their fuzzy softness, warmth, and durability, and they can be dyed or printed. Thought to have been popularized in Wales in the 17th century, flannel was an all-wool fabric made of woolen or worsted yarns, with a brushed surface and a soft napped finish obscuring its weave. Flannel may be plain woven or twill woven and, today, most flannel fabrics are made of cotton fibers or synthetic rayon fibers that are slightly napped on both sides to resemble the old woolen or worsted yarn weaves. A wide range of flannel weights and textures is available. The fabric weight and quality of the napping affect the warmth and softness of the fabric. Many people prefer flannel bedding during the cold, winter months, but some flannel weights are appropriate in breathability and comfort all year long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j9qLZiOVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00BED4LIY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BED4LIY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BED4LIY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":807964,"name":"Butterfly Craze Daisy Lounge Flower Pillow - Cozy & Stylish Floor Cushion, Perfect Seating Solution for Teens & Kids, Machine Washable Aesthetic Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v5yAoM5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COZY AESTHETIC: This Butterfly Craze Flower Daisy Pillow with its plush construction and vibrant color options is a versatile addition to any big or small room in your home, making it a practical solution for comfortable seating with a touch of aesthetic elegance. Whether you're looking for a large or medium floor pillow to spruce up your living room, or a kids' floor cushion to make reading time even cozier, this pillow lounger is the perfect choice for those who love hippie room décor. PERFECT FOR ALL AGES: Our trendy daisy floor pillow is perfect for all ages. Available in a variety of colors, from soft pinks to muted blues, it complements any design aesthetic. Add personality to your child's playroom or college dorm with this fun and stylish cushion. Its cozy and inviting design makes it a must-have for any room in your home. With comfort and style, it also makes a great gift. Enhance your space today and bring a touch of charm to your pastel room décor. CUSTOMIZE TO YOUR PREFERENCE: Get cozy for family game night with our versatile floor pillows. With two sizes to choose from - Large (35\" diameter) and Medium (20\" diameter) - you can mix and match to suit your seating needs. Create a lounge area with a single large pillow or add extra seating with two medium-sized pillows. The possibilities are endless, so why not bring a touch of comfort and relaxation to your den with these medium and giant floor pillows! EPITOME OF COMFORT & QUALITY: Made from the finest microfiber fabric, it feels ultra-soft and smooth to the touch, like velvet. The plush material not only provides unbeatable comfort but also durability, ensuring that it retains its shape and luxury feel for years to come. Perfect for lounging on the floor, reading a book or just relaxing, this pillow is the ultimate addition to your home décor. Indulge in ultimate comfort and elevate your living space with this luxurious floor pillow cushion. MACHINE WASHABLE: This floor cushion is not only stain resistant but also machine washable, making it incredibly easy to clean. For quick touch-ups, simply spot-clean with a damp cloth or sponge. For a deeper cleanse, feel free to machine wash it on a gentle cycle with cold water. To retain its pristine condition, air drying is recommended. This cushion is perfect for those seeking both comfort and low-maintenance solutions with its hassle-free cleaning and practicality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v5yAoM5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butterfly Craze","source_asin":"B0BF2J1127","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-807964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF2J1127","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF2J1127","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
